  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When changing back to Release from Open Beta, I found the Release build could not load and instead hangs at the loading screen shortly after opening. \nThis appears to be because the open beta moves some files to a folder which doesn't exist in release. This folder can remain after leaving the open beta. The presence of this empty folder causes the release client to fail to load.\nSpecifically, it seems that the folder structure was changed from\n\"VRChat_Data\\Plugins\" \nto\n\"VRChat_Data\\Plugins\\x86_64\"\nand if Steam leaves this empty x86_64 folder without deleting it, release VRC fails to load. \nTo reproduce this, create an empty folder called x86_64 in the Plugins directory of the release build. \nLog:\nhttps://pastebin.com/WBBXvR1f",
